Khal Pono — often found with his khalasar encamped in temporary dwellings on the Dothraki Sea;  
Khal Moro — rides between scattered shelters and night camps, keeping his people in rough quarters;  
Khal Jhaqo — rules from a moving tent-city of portable lodgings;  
Khal Zekko — still living, with his riders sleeping in travel camps rather than permanent homes;  
Khal Ko — alive, leading a khalasar that makes its living spaces wherever it stops.
